{"title":"Arrow","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Bowyer Lv 1) · Monster drop: Dune Skirmisher, Skeleton Knight, Sael Quickstring, Bogling, Ogre Butcher +3 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Bowyer at level 1 <span class=\"muted\">(47 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/pine-wood\">Pine Wood</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/feather\">Feather</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Normal, 14.9% of recorded drops (139 / 936 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14.9%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"skeleton-knight\" title=\"Skeleton Knight - Normal, 1.2% of recorded drops (2 / 166 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/440f07a708d79a6d9303.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Skeleton Knight</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1.2%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Sael Quickstring - Elite, 18.2% of recorded drops (2 / 11 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/491a153af36e89ea9f44.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sael Quickstring</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">18.2%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bogling\" title=\"Bogling - Normal, 1.4% of recorded drops (1 / 73 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/40fefc5bf6085eae0053.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bogling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1.4%</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+4 more\">+4 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - Normal, 8.3% of recorded drops (1 / 12 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8.3%</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-youth\" title=\"Ogre Youth - Normal, 12.5% of recorded drops (1 / 8 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/8fe05349771531a800b3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Youth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">12.5%</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"skeleton-man-at-arms\" title=\"Skeleton Man At Arms - Normal, 0.5% of recorded drops (1 / 189 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/06e9ed76c917cacb3bdc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Skeleton Man At Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.5%</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-marauder\" title=\"Dune Marauder - Normal, 0.6% of recorded drops (1 / 155 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9bef3010fbd730cd4612.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Marauder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.6%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"arrow\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/bowyer\">Bowyer</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/herblore\">Herblore</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/pine-wood\"><img class=\"q-mini\" s